msgid "Ab initio multiple spawning dynamics (AIMS)"
msgstr "从头算多重生成动力学 (AIMS)"

msgid "Bibliography:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from use of this program must acknowledge the "
"above. See also:"
msgstr "所有使用本程序产生的出版物必须引用上述文献。另请参阅："

msgid ""
"The AIMS module implements the Ab Initio Multiple Spawning method to perform"
" dynamics calculations on multiple electronic states. Although the program "
"was designed for non-adiabatic dynamics with CASSCF wavefunctions, it can be"
" used quite generally for first principles molecular dynamics, provided that"
" nuclear gradients are available."
msgstr ""
"AIMS 模块实现了从头算多重生成方法，用于在多个电子态上进行动力学计算。虽然该程序最初设计用于结合 CASSCF "
"波函数的非绝热动力学，但只要核梯度可用，它通常也可用于第一性原理分子动力学。"

msgid ""
"AIMS provides a description of a time-evolving molecular wavepacket with a "
"multi-configurational, product gaussian function basis. To allow the size of"
" the basis set to remain small while describing the wavepacket dynamics, the"
" centers of the full-dimensional gaussian functions follow classical "
"trajectories while their widths are kept fixed (the frozen Gaussian "
"approximation). When these classical trajectories encounter regions of large"
" non-adiabatic coupling to another electronic state, new basis functions are"
" *spawned* on the coupled state and the Time Dependent Schrödinger Equation "
"is solved in order to describe population transfer between the electronic "
"states. In this way, the description of the wavepacket can be systematically"
" improved by increasing the number of initial trajectory basis functions, "
"while reducing the coupling threshold at which trajectories spawned. "
"Alternatively, spawning can be disabled, and the method will reduce to "
"traditional first-principles classical molecular dynamics when a single "
"trajectory basis function is used."
msgstr ""
"AIMS "
"使用多组态、乘积高斯函数基组来描述随时间演化的分子波包。为了使基组尺寸在描述波包动力学时保持较小，全维度高斯函数的中心遵循经典轨迹，而其宽度保持固定（冻结高斯近似）。当这些经典轨迹遇到与另一个电子态存在较大非绝热耦合的区域时，新的基函数会在耦合态上\\"
" *生成*\\ "
"，并求解含时薛定谔方程以描述电子态之间的布居转移。通过这种方式，可以通过增加初始轨迹基函数的数量，同时降低轨迹生成的耦合阈值，来系统地改进波包的描述。或者，可以禁用生成功能，当使用单个轨迹基函数时，该方法将简化为传统的第一性原理经典分子动力学。"

msgid "Compilation"
msgstr "编译"

msgid ""
"AIMS is compiled as a component of Molpro; however, it requires a fortran "
"2003 compiler and is disabled unless the preprocessor variable MOLPRO_f2003 "
"is defined, which depends on the version of your compiler."
msgstr ""
"AIMS 作为 Molpro 的一个组件进行编译；但是，它需要一个 Fortran 2003 编译器，并且除非定义了预处理器变量 "
"MOLPRO_f2003，否则将被禁用，这取决于您编译器的版本。"

msgid "Structure of the input"
msgstr "输入结构"

msgid ""
"The AIMS program is controlled by the Molpro input deck and a number of "
"external text files:"
msgstr "AIMS 程序由 Molpro 输入卡和若干外部文本文件控制："

msgid "Molpro input deck"
msgstr "Molpro 输入卡"

msgid ""
"The AIMS program is invoked by the command AIMS. The details of the "
"electronic structure are defined in specifically named procedures. At a "
"minimum, for first principles dynamics, AIMS requires the following "
"structure to the input deck:"
msgstr ""
"AIMS 程序通过命令 AIMS 调用。电子结构的细节在特定命名的过程中定义。至少，对于第一性原理动力学，AIMS 要求输入文件具有以下结构："

msgid "``MPINIT={ Electronic structure routines for initial wavefunction }``"
msgstr "``MPINIT={ Electronic structure routines for initial wavefunction }``"

msgid ""
"``MPCALC={ Electronic structure routines for dynamics calculations. At a "
"minimum, must include: ener(1)=energy(1) ener(2)=energy(2)etc force }``"
msgstr ""
"``MPCALC={ Electronic structure routines for dynamics calculations. At a "
"minimum, must include: ener(1)=energy(1) ener(2)=energy(2)etc force }``"

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid ""
"``dir`` (string) Relative directory to AIMS input files. (Default is working"
" directory)."
msgstr "``dir`` (字符串) 指向 AIMS 输入文件的相对目录。（默认为工作目录）。"

msgid ""
"Note: the above is appropriate only for first-principles dynamics (without "
"spawning). CASSCF spawning calculations require additional procedures and a "
"specific structure to the MPINIT and MPCALC procedures. See the examples in "
"section `examples <ab_initio_multiple_spawning_dynamics.html#examples>`__."
msgstr ""
"注意：以上仅适用于第一性原理动力学（无生成过程）。CASSCF 生成计算需要额外的步骤以及 MPINIT 和 MPCALC 过程的特定结构。请参阅 "
"`示例 <ab_initio_multiple_spawning_dynamics.html#examples>`__ 一节中的例子。"

msgid "Control.dat"
msgstr "Control.dat"

msgid ""
"Control.dat is a fortran NAMELIST file storing the main parameters (in au) "
"of an AIMS simulation. At the end of the file, one can optionally specify "
"user-defined atom types (see below). Also time steps are in au, 1 au = "
"0.0241888 femtoseconds."
msgstr ""
"Control.dat 是一个 Fortran NAMELIST 文件，用于存储 AIMS "
"模拟的主要参数（以原子单位计）。在文件末尾，可以选择性地指定用户定义的原子类型（见下文）。时间步长也以原子单位计，1 原子单位 = 0.0241888 "
"飞秒。"

