msgstr "选择初始基态-激发态能隙在 :math:`\\pm 0.5\\times`\\ ``InitGapWidth`` 范围内。"

msgid "``InitGapWidth``"
msgstr "``InitGapWidth``"

msgid "``IRestartTraj``"
msgstr "``IRestartTraj``"

msgid "``Integer array (0)``"
msgstr "``Integer array (0)``"

msgid ""
"Subset of trajectories to restart from. Can restart a single dead "
"trajectory."
msgstr "要重启的轨迹子集。可以重启单个已终止的轨迹。"

msgid "``NumInitBasis``"
msgstr "``NumInitBasis``"

msgid "``Integer (1)``"
msgstr "``Integer (1)``"

msgid "Number of initial coupled basis functions."
msgstr "初始耦合基函数的数量。"

msgid "``FirstGauss``"
msgstr "``FirstGauss``"

msgid ""
"Place the first basis function at the molecular origin (that of "
"Geometry.dat), with zero momentum."
msgstr "将第一个基函数置于分子原点（Geometry.dat 中的原点），动量为零。"

msgid "``MirrorBasis``"
msgstr "``MirrorBasis``"

msgid "Mirror the initial basis on another electronic state, ``MirrorState``."
msgstr "将初始基镜像到另一个电子态 ``MirrorState`` 上。"

msgid "``MirrorState``"
msgstr "``MirrorState``"

