msgstr "调整镜像基函数（沿NACV方向）的动量以匹配原始基函数能量。"

msgid "``SharpEnergy``"
msgstr "``SharpEnergy``"

msgid ""
"Adjust momenta of all initial basis functions to match first basis function "
