"ground and excited states."
msgstr "对哈密顿量的对角元施加 ``+ExShift`` 的偏移，以改善振幅/相位传播。良好的选择是基态和激发态的平均势能。"

msgid "``CoupTimeStep``"
msgstr "``CoupTimeStep``"

msgid "``Real (TimeStep/4)``"
msgstr "``Real (TimeStep/4)``"

msgid "Timestep to use in regions of large nonadiabatic coupling."
msgstr "在非绝热耦合较大的区域中使用的时间步长。"

msgid "``TimeStepRejection``"
msgstr "``TimeStepRejection``"

msgid "``Logical (.true.)``"
msgstr "``Logical (.true.)``"

msgid "Enables adaptive time-stepping when encountering integration problems."
msgstr "在遇到积分问题时启用自适应时间步长。"

msgid "``MinTimeStep``"
msgstr "``MinTimeStep``"

msgid "``Real (CoupTimeStep/4)``"
msgstr "``Real (CoupTimeStep/4)``"

msgid "Minimum timestep to use when adaptive time-stepping."
msgstr "使用自适应时间步长时的最小时间步长。"

msgid "``DieOnMinStep``"
msgstr "``DieOnMinStep``"

msgid "Stop calculation if minimum timestep is reached."
msgstr "如果达到最小时间步长，则停止计算。"

msgid "``EnergyStepCons``"
msgstr "``EnergyStepCons``"

msgid "``Real (0.005)``"
msgstr "``Real (0.005)``"

msgid ""
"Allowed violation of classical energy conservation before timestep is "
"rejected."
msgstr "在时间步被拒绝前，允许违反经典能量守恒的程度。"

msgid "``NormCons``"
msgstr "``NormCons``"

msgid "``Real (0.25)``"
msgstr "``Real (0.25)``"

msgid "Permitted deviation in Norm from beginning of simulation."
msgstr "允许的范数相对于模拟开始时的偏差。"

msgid "``RejectAllStateFlip``"
msgstr "``RejectAllStateFlip``"

msgid ""
"Reject a timestep if any two electronic states flip. If ``.false.`` then "
"only reject if state is coupled to occupied state."
msgstr "如果任意两个电子态发生翻转，则拒绝该时间步。如果为 ``.false.``\\ ，则仅当态与占据态耦合时才拒绝。"

msgid "``OlapThresh``"
msgstr "``OlapThresh``"

msgid "``Real (0.001)``"
msgstr "``Real (0.001)``"

msgid ""
"Threshold overlap between two trajectories below which matrix elements not "
"calculated."
msgstr "两条轨迹之间的重叠阈值，低于此值则不计算矩阵元。"

msgid "``RegThresh``"
msgstr "``RegThresh``"

msgid "``Real (0.0001)``"
msgstr "``Real (0.0001)``"

msgid "Threshold to regularize the overlap matrix before inversion."
msgstr "在求逆之前用于正则化重叠矩阵的阈值。"

msgid "``Constrain``"
msgstr "``Constrain``"

msgid "Apply geometric constraints? If yes, supply Constraints.dat"
msgstr "应用几何约束？如果是，请提供 Constraints.dat 文件"

msgid "Spawning"
msgstr "生成"

msgid "``CSThresh``"
msgstr "``CSThresh``"

msgid "``Real (0.1)``"
msgstr "``Real (0.1)``"

msgid "Threshold Coupling, above which to spawn."
msgstr "阈值耦合，高于此值将生成新轨迹。"

msgid "``PopToSpawn``"
msgstr "``PopToSpawn``"

msgid "Minimum population a trajectory must have before it can spawn."
msgstr "轨迹在能够生成新轨迹前必须具有的最小布居数。"

msgid "``OMax``"
msgstr "``OMax``"

msgid "``Real (0.8)``"
msgstr "``Real (0.8)``"

msgid ""
"Prevent spawning if overlap of spawned trajectory with existing basis "
"greater than ``Omax``."
msgstr "若生成的轨迹与现有基组的重叠度大于 ``Omax``\\ ，则阻止生成。"

msgid "``MaxTraj``"
msgstr "``MaxTraj``"

msgid "``Real (100)``"
msgstr "``Real (100)``"

msgid ""
"Maximum number of allowed trajectories. Above which, spawning is disabled."
msgstr "允许的最大轨迹数。超过此数量时，生成功能将被禁用。"

msgid "``IgnoreState``"
msgstr "``IgnoreState``"

msgid ""
"Stop dynamics of trajectories on ``IgnoreState``. if not coupled for at "
"least ``DecoherenceTime``. Choose 1 if only interested in excited states."
msgstr ""
"停止在 ``IgnoreState`` 上的轨迹动力学，如果至少 ``DecoherenceTime`` 时间内未发生耦合。若仅对激发态感兴趣，请选择 "
"1。"

msgid "``MaxEDiff``"
msgstr "``MaxEDiff``"

msgid "``Real (0.03)``"
msgstr "``Real (0.03)``"

msgid ""
"Energy gap threshold for calculating nonadiabatic couplings, above which, "
"coupling taken to be zero."
msgstr "计算非绝热耦合的能隙阈值，高于此值时，耦合取为零。"

msgid "``DecoherenceTime``"
msgstr "``DecoherenceTime``"

msgid "``Real (200.0)``"
msgstr "``Real (200.0)``"

msgid "``SpawnCoupV``"
msgstr "``SpawnCoupV``"

msgid ""
"Use Coup.velocity as criterion for spawning rather than Coupling magnitude "
