"FrequenciesMP.dat contains the normal-mode frequencies and displacements of "
"the molecule in its initial geometry and electronic state (usually the "
"ground state). This information is used in the generation of initial "
"conditions. If ``InitialCond``\\ :math:`\\neq`\\ ``'NoSample'`` then either "
"this file, Hessian.dat or Frequencies.dat (Sections `Hessian.dat "
"<ab_initio_multiple_spawning_dynamics.html#hessian-dat>`__ and "
"`Frequencies.dat <ab_initio_multiple_spawning_dynamics.html#frequencies-"
"dat>`__ respectively) must be present. The format of FrequenciesMP.dat "
"follows the Molpro output of a Frequencies calculation (note: in the first "
"line, the number of normal modes has to be given; the rest is as in the "
"Molpro output):"
msgstr ""
"FrequenciesMP.dat 文件包含分子在其初始几何结构和电子态（通常是基态）下的简正模式频率和位移。这些信息用于生成初始条件。如果 "
"``InitialCond``\\ :math:`\\neq`\\ ``'NoSample'``\\ ，则必须存在此文件、Hessian.dat 或 "
"Frequencies.dat 文件（分别对应章节 `Hessian.dat "
"<ab_initio_multiple_spawning_dynamics.html#hessian-dat>`__ 和 "
"`Frequencies.dat <ab_initio_multiple_spawning_dynamics.html#frequencies-"
"dat>`__\\ ）。FrequenciesMP.dat 的格式遵循 Molpro 频率计算输出（注意：第一行必须给出简正模式的数量；其余部分与 "
"Molpro 输出一致）："

msgid "Hessian.dat"
msgstr "Hessian.dat"

msgid ""
"As an alternative to FrequenciesMP.dat, AIMS can generate the normal mode "
"frequencies after reading in the Hessian from Hessian.dat. The format of "
"this file is:"
msgstr ""
"作为 FrequenciesMP.dat 的替代方案，AIMS 可以在从 Hessian.dat 读取 Hessian "
"矩阵后生成简正模式频率。该文件的格式为："

msgid ""
"Note: the Hessian should not be mass weighted. It is permissible to have "
"carriage returns in the list of Hessian components."
msgstr "注意：Hessian 矩阵不应进行质量加权。在 Hessian 分量列表中允许存在回车符。"

msgid "Frequencies.dat"
msgstr "Frequencies.dat"

msgid ""
"As an alternative to FrequenciesMP.dat and Hessian.dat, AIMS can read in "
"normal-mode frequencies and vectors in AIMS format in Frequencies.dat. The "
"format of this file is:"
msgstr ""
"作为 FrequenciesMP.dat 和 Hessian.dat 的替代方案，AIMS 可以从 Frequencies.dat 文件中读取 AIMS"
" 格式的简正模式频率和向量。该文件的格式为："

msgid ""
"Note: Frequencies must be in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`, but normal mode vectors can"
" be mass scaled or not- AIMS will detect. Also, it is permissible to have "
"carriage returns in the list of frequencies and mode vectors. This file is "
"generated by AIMS if either FrequenciesMP.dat or Hessian.dat is used "
"initially."
msgstr ""
"注意：频率必须以 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}` 为单位，但简正模式向量可以经过质量缩放或未经缩放——AIMS "
"会自动检测。此外，在频率和模式向量列表中允许存在回车符。如果最初使用了 FrequenciesMP.dat 或 Hessian.dat，AIMS "
"会生成此文件。"

msgid "Constraints.dat"
msgstr "Constraints.dat"

msgid ""
"If ``Constraint=.true.`` then Constraints.dat must be supplied. This is a "
"fortran NAMELIST file that defines the geometric constraints in the system. "
"These constraints are enforced with the RATTLE algorithm. The parameters "
"contained in this file are:"
msgstr ""
"如果 ``Constraint=.true.``\\ ，则必须提供 Constraints.dat 文件。这是一个 Fortran NAMELIST "
"文件，用于定义系统中的几何约束。这些约束通过 RATTLE 算法强制执行。该文件包含的参数有："

msgid "Constraint parameters"
msgstr "约束参数"

msgid "``NumBonds``"
msgstr "``NumBonds``"

msgid "Number of bond lengths to constrain. Define IBondPtcles below."
msgstr "要约束的键长数量。请在下方定义 IBondPtcles。"

msgid "``IBondPtcles(2,NumBonds)``"
msgstr "``IBondPtcles(2,NumBonds)``"

msgid "List of atom indices that are bonded. See NumBonds above."
msgstr "成键的原子指标列表。请参见上方的 NumBonds。"

msgid "``NumAngles``"
msgstr "``NumAngles``"

msgid "Number of bond angles to constrain. Define IAnglePtcles below."
msgstr "要约束的键角数量。请在下方定义 IAnglePtcles。"

msgid "``IAnglePtcles(3,NumAngles)``"
msgstr "``IAnglePtcles(3,NumAngles)``"

msgid "``NComAtoms``"
msgstr "``NComAtoms``"

msgid ""
"Number of atoms that define the center-of-mass constraint. Define ICOMPtcles"
" below."
msgstr "定义质心约束的原子数量。在下方定义 ICOMPtcles。"

msgid "``ICOMPtcles(NComAtoms)``"
msgstr "``ICOMPtcles(NComAtoms)``"

msgid "List of atom indices that define the center of mass."
msgstr "定义质心的原子指标列表。"

msgid "``Toler``"
msgstr "``Toler``"

msgid "``Real (1E-4)``"
msgstr "``Real (1E-4)``"

msgid "Rattle tolerance"
msgstr "Rattle 容差"

msgid "``MaxIts``"
msgstr "``MaxIts``"

msgid "``Integer (10000)``"
msgstr "``Integer (10000)``"

msgid "Maximum number of Rattle iterations"
msgstr "Rattle 迭代的最大次数"

msgid "Note, a maximum of 1000 constraints is allowed."
msgstr "注意，最多允许 1000 个约束。"

msgid "Running a CASSCF spawning calculation"
msgstr "运行 CASSCF 生成计算"

msgid ""
"This section gives an overview of how to set up and run a CASSCF ab initio "
"multiple spawning calculation."
msgstr "本节概述如何设置和运行 CASSCF 从头算多重生成计算。"

msgid ""
"Beyond the regular molpro output, which contains the electronic structure "
"output, AIMS writes to a number of text files, depending on the output "
"parameters in Control.dat (section `Control.dat "
"<ab_initio_multiple_spawning_dynamics.html#control-dat>`__). All values are "
"given in atomic units unless otherwise specified. Electronic properties of a"
" trajectory are evaluated at the center geometry of the trajectory basis "
"function."
msgstr ""
"除了包含电子结构输出的常规 molpro 输出外，AIMS 还会根据 Control.dat 中的输出参数（章节 `Control.dat "
"<ab_initio_multiple_spawning_dynamics.html#control-dat>`__\\ "
"）写入多个文本文件。除非另有说明，所有值均以原子单位给出。轨迹的电子属性在轨迹基函数的中心几何处进行评估。"

msgid ""
"**FMS.out** Current progress of simulation and any warning/error messages."
msgstr "**FMS.out** 模拟的当前进度以及任何警告/错误消息。"

msgid ""
"**E.dat** Wavepacket energies. QM energies are expectation values of the "
"quantum operators, including coherences between the trajectory basis "
"functions. CL energies are averages of the trajectories’ classical energies,"
" weighted by the amplitude norm of each trajectory."
msgstr ""
"**E.dat** 波包能量。QM 能量是量子算符的期望值，包括轨迹基函数之间的相干性。CL 能量是轨迹经典能量的平均值，按每个轨迹的振幅范数加权。"

msgid ""
"**N.dat** Electronic populations, the sum of which should be conserved."
msgstr "**N.dat** 电子布居数，其总和应守恒。"

msgid "**TrajDump.i** Dynamic variables for trajectory i."
msgstr "**TrajDump.i** 轨迹 i 的动态变量。"

msgid ""
"**Amp.i** Amplitudes of trajectory i. Note: since the product Gaussian basis"
" is non-orthogonal, the amplitude norms do not necessarily sum to 1."
msgstr "**Amp.i** 轨迹 i 的振幅。注意：由于乘积高斯基是非正交的，振幅范数之和不一定等于 1。"

msgid ""
"**PotEn.i** Electronic energies for trajectory i. The last column displays "
"the total classical energy of the trajectory, which should be conserved."
msgstr "**PotEn.i** 轨迹 i 的电子能量。最后一列显示轨迹的总经典能量，该值应守恒。"

msgid ""
"**positions.i.xyz** Snapshots of trajectory i’s center geometry in XYZ "
"format (Angstrom)."
msgstr "**positions.i.xyz** 轨迹 i 中心几何结构的 XYZ 格式快照（埃）。"

msgid ""
"**Coup.i** Nonadiabatic couplings of each state to the occupied state for "
"trajectory i. The first nstate columns contain the magnitude of coupling "
"vectors and the last nstate columns contain the projection of the coupling "
"onto the velocity vector."
msgstr ""
"**Coup.i** 轨迹 i 中每个态与占据态的非绝热耦合。前 nstate 列包含耦合向量的大小，后 nstate 列包含耦合在速度向量上的投影。"

msgid ""
"**Charge.i** Partial atomic charges corresponding to the occupied electronic"
" state of trajectory i. The molpro input deck must contain a Mulliken "
"population analysis directive in the ``MPCALC`` procedure."
msgstr ""
"**Charge.i** 对应于轨迹 i 占据电子态的部分原子电荷。Molpro 输入卡必须在 ``MPCALC`` 过程中包含 Mulliken "
"布居分析指令。"

msgid "**Dipole.i** Dipole moments of each electronic state for trajectory i."
msgstr "**Dipole.i** 轨迹 i 中每个电子态的偶极矩。"

msgid ""
"**TDip.i** Transition dipoles from ground to excited states for trajectory "
"i."
msgstr "**TDip.i** 轨迹 i 中从基态到激发态的跃迁偶极矩。"

msgid ""
"**QMRR.i** Isotropic quadrupole moment :math:`\\langle r^2 \\rangle` of each"
" electronic state for trajectory i. The molpro input deck must contain "
"``EXPEC,QMRR``."
msgstr ""
"**QMRR.i** 轨迹 i 中每个电子态的各向同性四极矩 :math:`\\langle r^2 \\rangle`\\ 。Molpro "
"输入卡必须包含 ``EXPEC,QMRR``\\ 。"

msgid "**CIVec.i** CI Vectors for each state of trajectory i."
msgstr "**CIVec.i** 轨迹 i 中每个态的 CI 向量。"

msgid ""
"**CFxn.dat** The overlap correlation function :math:`\\langle \\Psi(t) | "
"\\Psi(0) \\rangle`."
msgstr "**CFxn.dat** 重叠相关函数 :math:`\\langle \\Psi(t) | \\Psi(0) \\rangle`\\ 。"

msgid "**H.dat** Hamiltonian matrix."
msgstr "**H.dat** 哈密顿矩阵。"

msgid ""
"**S.dat** Overlap matrix. Note: the overlap between trajectories on "
"different states is zero, but is displayed here as if they were on the same "
"state."
msgstr "**S.dat** 重叠矩阵。注意：不同态上的轨迹之间的重叠为零，但此处显示为如同它们处于同一态上。"

msgid "**SDot.dat** The time derivative of the Overlap matrix."
msgstr "**SDot.dat** 重叠矩阵的时间导数。"

msgid "**i.j.molf** Molden file for trajectory i at time j."
msgstr "**i.j.molf** 轨迹 i 在时间 j 的 Molden 文件。"

msgid "**Checkpoint.txt** Restart file with history."
msgstr "**Checkpoint.txt** 包含历史的重启文件。"

msgid "**Last_Bundle.txt** Restart file for the last written timestep."
msgstr "**Last_Bundle.txt** 最后写入时间步的重启文件。"

msgid "**Spawn.log** Details of successful spawns."
msgstr "**Spawn.log** 成功生成事件的详细信息。"

msgid "**FailSpawn.log** Details of unsuccessful spawns."
msgstr "**FailSpawn.log** 未成功生成事件的详细信息。"

msgid "**Spawn.i** XYZ file of geometry where trajectory i was spawned."
msgstr "**Spawn.i** 轨迹 i 产生处的几何结构 XYZ 文件。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"The following two examples show how AIMS can be run in either single-state "
"first-principle molecular dynamics mode, or multi-state spawning mode. The "
"parameters found in these input files were chosen for illustrative purposes "
"and are not necessarily appropriate for your system of interest. It is "
"recommended the literature be consulted before performing AIMS simulations."
msgstr ""
"以下两个示例展示了如何以单态第一性原理分子动力学模式或多态产生模式运行 "
"AIMS。这些输入文件中的参数是为说明目的而选择的，不一定适用于您所研究的体系。建议在进行 AIMS 模拟前查阅相关文献。"

msgid "Ethylene Hartree-Fock First-Principles Molecular Dynamics"
msgstr "乙烯 Hartree-Fock 第一性原理分子动力学"

msgid "See examples/aims_ethyl_HF"
msgstr "参见 examples/aims_ethyl_HF"

msgid "Ethylene CASSCF Spawning Dynamics"
msgstr "乙烯 CASSCF 产生动力学"

msgid "See examples/aims_ethyl_CASSCF"
msgstr "参见 examples/aims_ethyl_CASSCF"
